{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21792","headline":"有鸟二十章 六 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟羣翠碧，毛羽短长心竝窄。\n皆曾偷食渌池鱼，前去後来更逼迫。\n食鱼满腹各自飞，池上见人长似客。\n飞飞竞占嘉树林，百鸟不争缘凤惜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}